{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not turn MDC snapshot failure into terminal workflow failure.** A nonfatal exception from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is passed through `finishInvocation`, returning durable `FAILED` before input processing or user code starts. A transient logging-binding fault can therefore permanently terminate user work. Fall back to execution without MDC restoration or propagate an invocation-level infrastructure failure so Lambda retries instead.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JREt","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":256,"observation_digest":"3a4f2a647b9c77112a30c371054037a9034553c0e372fe737b771040b19b4c98","observation_id":"aro_v1_hjhsuzd3tr3rckrqynyqkqbxve","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ypy2y57vtva3tue6ol67lga5xg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2cc073779905eb2b61db09fe0e50e867759edd7a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":256,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_3h5bbu5yhdelesve2tkysh42g2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
